Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}
###

#### 3.2.3 List with ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}
###

#### 3.2.4 Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "Cyber Security Advanced"
  }
