{
  "data": {
    "name": "Ajarn Somchai"
  }
}
###

#### 3.3.2 List All
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}
###

#### 3.3.3 List with ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}
###

#### 3.3.4 Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}
